herdbook-agents is a modified copy of the `agents` mod shipped with the Herdr
desktop app 0.1.16 (https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr-app), licensed under
the Apache License 2.0 (LICENSE in this folder).

Changes from the original: in the grouped view each tab's agents sit in a
rounded frame tinted with the space's color, with a header that folds it
(kept in localStorage "groupsFolded") and renames the tab on double-click;
spaces and agents order by their latest state change (groups.js); space
headers carry the space's color tile; rows show the terminal's `pane-name`
label; a right-click opens herdbook-menu when it's installed. The sort popup
opens herdbook-agents instead of agents.
